/span></a>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"wp-rows\"><a class=\"wp-row\" href=\"/contact/\"><b>Contact</b><span class=\"wp-go\">›</span></a></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"lang-link\" href=\"/bn/\" lang=\"bn\">বাংলা</a>\n      <button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-controls=\"wishly-guide-navigation\" class=\"menu-toggle mobile-nav-toggle\" type=\"button\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"page-heading\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">GET IN TOUCH</span><h1>Questions, feedback<br/><em>or a correction?</em></h1><p>Contact the Wishly team about guide corrections, product questions, editorial feedback or website-related enquiries.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"page-body\"><div class=\"container policy-layout\"><article class=\"article\"><p class=\"policy-updated\">Last updated: 7 November 2026</p><h2>Contact the Wishly team</h2><p>For questions about Wishly Guide, product features, templates or an article correction, visit the <a href=\"https://wishly.bd/contact\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">official Wishly contact page</a>. This keeps enquiries in the same support channel used by the main Wishly website.</p><h2>What to include in a correction</h2><p>Please include the article URL, the sentence or instruction that needs attention and—when possible—a short explanation of the correct information. Do not send passwords, payment details or other sensitive information.</p><h2>Publisher and project</h2><p>Wishly Guide is an information website associated with Wishly, created by RA Fahim. Visit <a href=\"https://wishly.bd/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Wishly</a> for the main website or <a href=\"https://rafahim.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">RA Fahim’s website</a> for founder information.</p></article></div></section></main><footer class=\"site-foote